response:
The incident involves threat actor UAC-0026 distributing the HeaderTip malware via a malicious RAR archive referencing Russian army crimes. The archive contains an executable dropping a decoy PDF impersonating the National Police of Ukraine and auxiliary files (officecleaner.dat, officecleaner.bat) to reconstruct and execute the HeaderTip DLL (httpshelper.dll) on Windows systems.

